      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "これを見れば、\r\n飛空艇部隊を作ったときの思いが蘇って、\r\nスコットもやる気を取り戻すかも……。",
        "official_en": "I thought maybe he’d remember the passion he once had for the squadron if he saw this.",
        "real_en": "If he sees this, maybe it'll bring back how he felt when we started the squadron... and rekindle his motivation."
      },
